// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : A Piece of Evidence (Hero 01) 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1971795734" "A Piece of Evidence (Hero 01)"
// LocationString :
"P1970658262" "This is a Vigilante mission."
// ProfessionString :
"P3152031925" "Profession String"
// DescriptionString :
"P3881315282" "You've found some evidence on an enemy you defeated. If you were to act upon it, the people in Paragon City would perceive you as a Vigilante. A Vigilante is someone who doesn't follow the letter of the law, but instead believes in more in results then ideals. Are you that type of person?"
// WrongAllianceString :
"P1787117514" "I mistrust your motives, {HeroName}, and I mistrust you. Leave me be."
// ContactRequiresText :
"P1670354328" "You are of the wrong alignment to get this contact."
// HelloString :
"P3718562803" "<font face=title><color SlateGray>Vigilante: A Piece of Evidence</color></font><br><br>You've got a piece evidence off of a defeated enemy. The manner in which you'd have to act upon it would make the people of Paragon City perceive you as a <color SlateGray>Vigilante</color>.<br><br><color orange>A Vigilante is someone who doesn't follow the letter of the law, but instead believes the end justifies the means when it comes to stopping crime. Some Vigilantes even go so far as to believe that if you are not actively stopping crime, you're no better than the criminals who commit them.<br><br>Are you that type of person?</color>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1658622802" "Funny thing is, I'm an auto-issue contact, so you should probably never see this."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2079156588" "No Task Remaining"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P970434655" "As much as you'd like to investigate this piece of evidence, you've got to many other things on your plate to give it the attention it requires."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P998890811" "Come Back Later"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P856364347" ""
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2593105069" "This piece of Evidence doesn't lead you anywhere."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


